{% doc %}
  The text laid over a full-bleed photograph on the homepage (Figma): a
  category title, a short paragraph and an underlined link, sitting at the
  bottom-left of the image. Shared by the two-up band and the mixed band so
  the three of them line up to the same inset.

  The tone is the merchant's call because it depends on the photograph: over
  a dark room, light type; over a pale seamless, ink. Neither is safe by
  default, so the setting has no "auto" — whoever places the image looks at
  it.

  @param {string} [heading] - category title, set in caps by the stylesheet
  @param {string} [body] - one short paragraph; line breaks are kept
  @param {string} [cta_label] - the link's words, e.g. "Shop kitchenware"
  @param {string} [link] - where the link goes. With no link the label is
    still drawn (as plain text), so a band can carry a bare caption.
  @param {string} [tone] - 'light' or 'ink'
  @param {boolean} [scrim] - lay a soft gradient under the words. Off by
    design: the brand does not use scrims. It exists because these
    photographs are not all the same tone under the text, and measured
    against the real pixels most of them leave light type under 4.5:1 — see
    the QA note. Turning it on is a design call, not a default.
  @example
  {% render 'media-overlay', heading: 'Vases & vessels', body: text, cta_label: 'Shop kitchenware', link: url, tone: 'light' %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- if heading != blank or body != blank or cta_label != blank -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    The scrim is a layer of the whole photograph, not of the text box: the
    box has a max-width, and a gradient hung on it stopped short of the
    image's right edge.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if scrim -%}
    <span class="media-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  {%- endif -%}
  <div class="media-overlay{% if tone == 'light' %} media-overlay--light{% endif %}">
    {%- if heading != blank -%}
      <h2 class="media-overlay__heading">{{ heading | escape | newline_to_br }}</h2>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if body != blank -%}
      <p class="media-overlay__body">{{ body | escape | newline_to_br }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if cta_label != blank -%}
      {%- if link != blank -%}
        <a href="{{ link }}" class="media-overlay__cta type-label">{{ cta_label | escape }}</a>
      {%- else -%}
        <span class="media-overlay__cta type-label">{{ cta_label | escape }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
